  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project component is to improve living conditions and reduce poverty through reducing the potential for conflict. The project will address the conflict potential through improving capacities of local authorities and communities to deal with conflict, facilitating income generating activities and mitigating local tension over resources and breaking isolation.</narrative>
